<title>UK: Merrill adds to Middle East, North Africa team.</title>
<headline>Merrill adds to Middle East, North Africa team.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch has added to its emerging markets coverage with the appointment of Nabil Menai as vice president with responsibility for the Middle East and North Africa.</p>
<p>Merrill said in a statement that Nabil joins from Societe Generale, where he was head of emerging market sales and before that head of emerging markets research.</p>
<p>-- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
